WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.800
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I’m&nbsp;
going to explain an American science&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.760
fiction film called “The Time Machine.” 
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
 
&nbsp;

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:19.280
The premise of the film is set in 1899. Dr.&nbsp;
Alexander Hartdegen is an associate professor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:24.480
of applied mechanics and engineering at Columbia&nbsp;
University. The movie starts as we see him working&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:29.680
on a formula, so much invested that his friend and&nbsp;
colleague, David Philby, has to remind him of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.960
date with his girlfriend Emma at 5. Hearing this,&nbsp;
Alexander quickly picks his notes and rushes back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:40.000
to his house to get ready. On his way, he and&nbsp;
David talk about all of Alex’s proposals that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.120
the University has rejected. David suggests&nbsp;
he make his proposals less radical for them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:51.040
to make them useful for humans. At Alex’s home,&nbsp;
they are greeted by his housekeeper, Mrs. Watchit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:56.000
They make Alex get into fancy new clothes and&nbsp;
he leaves to meet Emma. He finally meets Emma,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.200
the two walk in the central park talking. Alex&nbsp;
brings up his deteriorating health, and claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.560
he will only be good again when she marries him.&nbsp;
Emma, with teary eyes, accepts his proposal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:11.360
After a little hassling through his pockets, he&nbsp;
gives her a ring with her birthstone embedded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:16.640
in it. Emma is over the moon. However, a man&nbsp;
suddenly approaches them and circles around.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.600
He asks them for their money; when Alex tries to&nbsp;
retaliate, the mugger points his gun at him.
&nbsp;

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:26.640
Alex complies and gives the mugger his wallet&nbsp;
and watch, but when he asks for Emma’s ring,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:31.680
they deny it. The man then tries to snatch it&nbsp;
from her, and shoots her dead while struggling.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:36.480
Alex holds her in his arms calling her name,&nbsp;
while she takes her last breath and dies. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:41.440
is beyond devastated as he hugs her limp corpse&nbsp;
and cries in vain. The scene cuts to four years&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:46.880
later. Alex is writing a formula on the board,&nbsp;
researching something like he always does. He has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:51.840
still not been able to get over Emma’s death, and&nbsp;
has been busy with his work ever since. David and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:56.880
Mrs. Watchit are worried for him. That day when&nbsp;
David comes to meet him, he notices something on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.600
the other side of the curtains and demands David&nbsp;
to tell him what he is working on. David invites&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:06.560
him for dinner in a week and offers to show him&nbsp;
his invention then. A week goes by, and it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:12.240
finally the day. Alex dresses himself up, for the&nbsp;
first time since Emma’s death. He then opens the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:17.520
curtains and we see a piece of huge machinery on&nbsp;
the other side. It has many wheels and gears, in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:22.960
the middle, a chair is embedded. Alex sits on it&nbsp;
and looks at Emma’s picture on a locket. He slowly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:27.920
pulls down a lever, making a sphere shield around&nbsp;
him. The machine then puts itself in motion. 
&nbsp;

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:33.200
When Alex pulls down a final lever, the camera&nbsp;
zooms into a pocket watch and we see its hand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:38.880
move in an anticlockwise direction. As it turns&nbsp;
out, the machine Alex is using is a time machine.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:43.120
He has put his blood and sweat into the machine,&nbsp;
to go back to the day Emma died four years ago&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:47.840
and save her. In the following scene, we see&nbsp;
the future Alex in central park on the day of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:53.040
Emma’s death. She sees him and runs towards him.&nbsp;
Alex is stunned to see his precious love back.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:57.440
He kisses her in delight and runs her to the&nbsp;
nearest chariot to take her away from the park.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:02.000
They get off the chariot in the middle of&nbsp;
the city. Alex tells her to go to her home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.480
and stay there for the night. Assuming that the&nbsp;
past Alex will come to Emma’s home at night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:11.120
he tells her to not be confused and just remember&nbsp;
that he loves her. He leaves her by the side of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:16.080
the road to get her flowers as he promised. But&nbsp;
then, a vehicle hits her, killing Emma again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:21.120
Alex realizes that he cannot change Emma’s fate&nbsp;
and no matter what he does, she will die that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:26.000
night. But he doesn’t give up. He believes that&nbsp;
the people from the future have surely found a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:30.880
way to alter this factor, so he decides to go into&nbsp;
the future and study futuristic time machines. 
&nbsp;

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:37.200
He gets into the machine and pulls down the lever&nbsp;
again, this time setting the time to 2030. As he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:42.720
travels through time, he sees the world around&nbsp;
him changing. In 2030, he sees an advertisement&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:47.520
for a settlement being established on the moon.&nbsp;
He goes to the New York library, hoping to find&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:53.120
a book on time travel where he meets a hologram&nbsp;
of the librarian named Vox 114, and is stunned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:59.120
by the technology. However, when he talks about&nbsp;
time travel, Vox 114 reveals that there hasn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:03.760
been any invention of such sort. Thinking that he&nbsp;
would have better luck a couple of years later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:10.320
he gets into the machine again and now travels to&nbsp;
the year 2037. In 2037, the world has been fully&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:15.440
destroyed. The lunar habitation program has made&nbsp;
the earth inhabitable because the moon was pulled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:20.240
closer to it. The gravitational forces of the&nbsp;
bodies change causing frequent earthquakes and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:24.880
tsunamis on earth. The lunar habitation has caused&nbsp;
a huge crack on the surface of the moon. 
&nbsp;

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:31.040
Two policemen, who are evacuating the earth,&nbsp;
arrest Alex to take him to his evacuation center.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.640
As he resists them, the ground&nbsp;
starts to shake and splits in half,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:40.080
spilling out hot lava. Alex quickly gets into his&nbsp;
machine and drives away; but amidst the chaos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:45.360
hits his head on a piece of metal, making him go&nbsp;
unconscious. The time machine starts its journey,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:50.640
but an unconscious Alex isn’t there to stop it.&nbsp;
When he finally opens his eyes, he sees that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:56.480
has reached the year 802,701, and quickly stops&nbsp;
the machine before falling unconscious again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:02.240
He wakes up in a bed with his wounds healed. 
As he wears his clothes, a little boy approaches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:06.880
him and runs away. Alex follows the kid and&nbsp;
sees that the future humans have reverted to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:11.440
a primitive lifestyle and live on cliffs. They&nbsp;
all come to Alex and watch him in awe, but do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:16.800
not seem to understand English, except for a girl&nbsp;
named Mara who can speak the language fluently.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:21.120
Alex tells her that he is a time traveller, but&nbsp;
Mara tells the others he is just a wandering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:26.400
fool so that they won’t kill him. Those people&nbsp;
are called the Elois. A loud honking is heard,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:32.560
and everyone goes into their shed. That night, he&nbsp;
stays at Mara and her brother, Kalen’s place. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:37.760
sees the broken pieces of the moon in the sky.&nbsp;
The following day, Mara takes Alex to his time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:44.240
machine. The two see that it has not been damaged.&nbsp;
Mara insists Alex take Kalen with him to the past.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:49.440
Before Alex can ask why, loud honking is heard&nbsp;
in the background. Mara freaks out and runs to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:54.320
save Kalen, as a confused Alex follows her.&nbsp;
Everyone around them starts running back to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:58.800
the cliffs as well. Suddenly, Alex comes&nbsp;
face to face with a beast life creature.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:04.480
They are called the Morlocks. More of them emerge&nbsp;
from the ground and start attacking everyone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.680
They tie the people they can get their&nbsp;
hands in, and take them into the ground. 
&nbsp;

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:13.520
Alex watches as one of them gets Mara and sinks&nbsp;
with her into the soil. When all of them are gone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:18.240
Alex tries asking the others where the Morlocks&nbsp;
take them, but Kalen tells him that when the Elois&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:22.720
are taken, they are not supposed to talk about&nbsp;
it. Kalen then takes Alex to the opening to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:28.640
world of the Morlocks. They climb down into a cave&nbsp;
and Alex realizes that it is the New York Library.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:34.640
The hologram of Vox 144 talks from behind them.&nbsp;
Since the technology worked on solar power,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:39.600
he has survived all these years. Alex is beyond&nbsp;
surprised, and asks him what is going on with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:45.920
the world now. Vox 114 replies that the human&nbsp;
race has evolved into two, Elois and Morlocks.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:51.440
This is the nature of the world now. The Morlocks&nbsp;
come to the surface to hunt Elois for survival.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:56.400
Vox then reveals that to reach the world of&nbsp;
Morlocks, they should follow the ‘breathing’.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.400 --> 00:07:00.400
Kalen and Alex hear the noise and follow&nbsp;
it to reach a massive statue of a demonic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:05.040
face whose mouth is an opening to Morlock's&nbsp;
world. He leaves Kalen outside and climbs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:10.240
down underground carefully. He finally reaches&nbsp;
the place and sees a whole civilization there.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:14.640
He then sneaks into a room, and accidentally&nbsp;
falls into a pond full of human remains.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.400
Alex is then found by a Morlock and&nbsp;
sent into their leader’s chamber. 
&nbsp;

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:23.360
The leader explains, that when the moon&nbsp;
dissociated, some people sank under the ground&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:28.000
with nowhere else to go. Over the years,&nbsp;
they evolved into flesh-eating Morlocks.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:33.760
Others miraculously survived on the surface&nbsp;
and repopulated, the Elois. The Morlocks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:38.400
tried to come back to the surface, but couldn’t,&nbsp;
because of the years of underground evolution.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:41.680
So they started to hunt the humans&nbsp;
from the surface for food and breeding.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:46.320
The leader also reveals that he has the power&nbsp;
to control both Elois and Morlocks’ minds,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:51.120
and controls the balance of the world through&nbsp;
them. He has also read Alex’s mind, and knows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:56.160
that he is a time traveller and his desire is&nbsp;
to bring Emma back. He makes Alex hallucinate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.160 --> 00:08:01.600
about his life if Emma hadn’t died. He is filled&nbsp;
with sadness, to see Emma and his kid playing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:05.760
The leader then concludes that humans cannot&nbsp;
change fate, because they are the results of their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:11.040
own actions. Then, he shows Alex the time machine&nbsp;
that he had brought into the Morlock world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:15.440
The leader wants him to go back to where he came&nbsp;
from, and not harm the balance of the society now.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:20.560
Alex quietly obliges but as he starts the&nbsp;
machine, he pulls the leader in with him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:25.440
The two struggle for a while. Alex holds him&nbsp;
outside the machine’s sphere and starts it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:30.240
The leader dies rapidly by ageing. He again&nbsp;
stops the machine in the future and sees the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:34.640
place is filled with Morlock’s cave, suggesting&nbsp;
that the place is now ruled by Morlocks. 
&nbsp;

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:39.040
Alex then comes back to save Mara,&nbsp;
and brings her out of the cage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:43.360
The Morlocks get angry and leap to attack&nbsp;
them, but Alex jams a gear in the machine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:48.480
creating a massive distortion in time. The time&nbsp;
machine explodes taking all of Morlock's world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:53.760
with it, but Mara and Alex manage to run out of&nbsp;
the cave just in time. With his time machine gone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:57.760
Alex decides to stay with Elois&nbsp;
as he has found satisfaction here.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:03.040
In the future, we see Vox 144 teaching&nbsp;
Elois children about the past of humans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:08.800
Alex brings Muri and Kalen to the place, where his&nbsp;
lab used to be. As he talks to them, somewhere in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:14.400
another time, David and Mrs. Watchit enter Alex’s&nbsp;
lab and discuss his disappearance. David claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:19.040
that Alex is happy wherever he is, and offers&nbsp;
Mrs. Watchit to come work as his housekeeper. 
&nbsp;

